          "usfm": "2TH.1.1",
          "note_ref": "1:1",
          "note_type": "footnote",
          "references": [],
          "text": "Greek Silvanus, a variant of Silas"
        },
        {
          "verse": 3,
          "usfm": "2TH.1.3",
          "note_ref": "1:3",
          "note_type": "footnote",
          "references": [],
          "text": "The Greek word for brothers and sisters (adelphoi) refers here to believers, both men and women, as part of God’s family; also in 2:1, 13, 15; 3:1, 6, 13."
        },
        {
          "verse": 12,
          "usfm": "2TH.1.12",
          "note_ref": "1:12",
          "note_type": "footnote",
          "references": [],
          "text": "Or God and Lord, Jesus Christ"
        }
      ],
